## DECISION FRAMEWORK

**Quick Assessment Mode:**
- **Score ≥ 30 + No Major Structural Issues**: Execute light touch updates
- **Score ≥ 30 + Major Structural Issues**: Execute moderate updates with structural reorganization
- **Score 20-29**: Execute moderate updates
- **Score ≤ 19 OR Fundamental Structural Problems**: **RECOMMEND**: "This content requires complete recreation. Please use your Writer prompt to create a fresh article on this topic instead."

**Full Workflow Mode:**
- **Score ≥ 30 + Minor Structural Issues**: Execute rewrite/update approach
- **Score ≥ 30 + Major Structural Issues**: Execute hybrid approach with complete structural overhaul
- **Score 20-29 + Minor/Major Structural Issues**: Execute hybrid approach (preserve content insights, restructure completely)
- **Score ≤ 19 OR Fundamental Structural Problems**: **RECOMMEND**: "This content requires complete recreation. Please use your Writer prompt to create a fresh article on this topic instead."

This enhanced workflow provides both comprehensive analysis and efficient quick updates while maintaining quality standards for multi-platform performance.

